NNAAMMEE
       pcap_can_set_rfmon  -  check whether monitor mode can be set for a not-
       yet-activated capture handle

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ##iinncclluuddee <<ppccaapp//ppccaapp..hh>>

